# Never rewrite line endings on checkout/checkin. This repo is byte-exact:
# committed data files (data/*.txt, data/scheme/*.json, data/families/**) are
# referenced by sha256 in reports and certificates, and scripts/*.sh break
# under CRLF. A clone on a box with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check
# everything out with CRLF (observed: scripts/setup_venv.sh fails with
# "set: pipefail: invalid option name").
* -text
